abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.6.1 is a teacher-adoption and cross-suite consistency release: it formalizes four early-course Quick Assigns, repairs landing/catalogue/search and four-locale round trips, standardizes the outer shell of Labs 13–15, adds a permanent applet design-system contract, and preserves the v1.6.0 algorithms and fifteen-lab curriculum boundary.
